constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `tests/external/live_jira_cloud_s3/_cloud_s3_support.py:1-13` — Preserve read-only Jira boundary, import-layout constraint, and mutator inventory role. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/external/live_jira_cloud_s3/conftest.py:1-42` — Preserve structural Jira write prohibition, isolated S3 store, opt-in layers, and teardown. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/external/live_jira_cloud_s3/test_cloud_s3_rehearsal.py:1-26` — Preserve read-only guarantee and the five scenario responsibilities. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest --collect-only tests/external/live_jira_cloud_s3/_cloud_s3_support.py tests/external/live_jira_cloud_s3/conftest.py tests/external/live_jira_cloud_s3/test_cloud_s3_rehearsal.py`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/external/live_jira_cloud_s3/_cloud_s3_support.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/external/live_jira_cloud_s3/conftest.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/external/live_jira_cloud_s3/test_cloud_s3_rehearsal.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","2d43-3c39-307e-4450"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"2d43-3c39-307e-4450","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_id":"8857-beba-8888-45f7","ticket_type":"task","title":"Condense comments in tests/external/live_jira_cloud_s3","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["75008238-8bc2-4c28-9fd9-d45dfe7e4965","fa2938af-f10b-4852-8012-91a1bc5894e0","803ec78f-08b1-40ed-b91d-c44eea1a7571","b2ba48b5-82a2-4b19-bd1e-a0b0d4b81427","d7371854-a827-463d-a007-df44bf3dad19"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788582728854633001,"uuid":"69b49290-f8da-44eb-88ac-f77c65e83953"}